<title>DENMARK: Danish Tivoli reports 1995/96 losses.</title>
<headline>Danish Tivoli reports 1995/96 losses.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Sept 30 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net turnover		    217.6     vs    234.4</p>
<p> Operating costs		  16.8     vs     27.1</p>
<p> Operating result		 -5.5     vs     -2.8</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		  -13.2     vs    -10.9</p>
<p> Net result			-50.8     vs    -18.8</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)   0.1     vs	0.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish amusement park operator is Tivoli A/S.It said in a statement that it saw continued loss in 1996/97. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom + 45-33-9</p>
</text>
